      "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The 100% Physics-based athlete simulator</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/ce043e6b251644413a49458e39f215b4.poster.avif?t=1694060749\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/ce043e6b251644413a49458e39f215b4.webm?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/ce043e6b251644413a49458e39f215b4.mp4?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Imagine gymnastics, parkour, and ninja obstacle courses all combined- and you get <strong>Pro Gymnast</strong>, an amazingly fluid and expressive physics-based game of skill and acrobatics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Direct Controls</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/b5bc0bdedfa4fb445ddc4919bf8f084b.poster.avif?t=1694060749\" width=480 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/b5bc0bdedfa4fb445ddc4919bf8f084b.webm?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/b5bc0bdedfa4fb445ddc4919bf8f084b.mp4?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Control your athlete directly with unique controls that allow unlimited expressive freedom (and hilarious fails!)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed By a Gymnast/Acrobat</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/2329818057f98103bc78a6e32772089c.poster.avif?t=1694060749\" width=480 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/2329818057f98103bc78a6e32772089c.webm?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/2329818057f98103bc78a6e32772089c.mp4?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>I've been doing gymnastics, trampoline, and trapeze my whole life! I made this game to share my love of the sport.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Avatar</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/1490569dd8cd2b5b0529c5bdca10e149.poster.avif?t=1694060749\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/1490569dd8cd2b5b0529c5bdca10e149.webm?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/1490569dd8cd2b5b0529c5bdca10e149.mp4?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Surprisingly deep avatar editor included!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Your Own Courses</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/06a816714323a9cdff3fa3e55702ec53.poster.avif?t=1694060749\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/06a816714323a9cdff3fa3e55702ec53.webm?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/06a816714323a9cdff3fa3e55702ec53.mp4?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fully-featured level editor and replay video exporter included.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simulate Realistic Gymnastics</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/492203955cde241124781edbc991eead.poster.avif?t=1694060749\" width=480 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/492203955cde241124781edbc991eead.webm?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/492203955cde241124781edbc991eead.mp4?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Players keep finding ways to simulate real-world gymnastics in the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/63bf9dbcd18d9c9394387dc75cac3a22.avif?t=1694060749\" width=200 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLLER STRONGLY RECOMMENDED</h2>This game was designed with a game controller (with 2 analog sticks and triggers) in mind.  Keyboard controls are available, but are not recommended.",
      "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The 100% Physics-based athlete simulator</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/ce043e6b251644413a49458e39f215b4.poster.avif?t=1694060749\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/ce043e6b251644413a49458e39f215b4.webm?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/ce043e6b251644413a49458e39f215b4.mp4?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Imagine gymnastics, parkour, and ninja obstacle courses all combined- and you get <strong>Pro Gymnast</strong>, an amazingly fluid and expressive physics-based game of skill and acrobatics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Direct Controls</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/b5bc0bdedfa4fb445ddc4919bf8f084b.poster.avif?t=1694060749\" width=480 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/b5bc0bdedfa4fb445ddc4919bf8f084b.webm?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/b5bc0bdedfa4fb445ddc4919bf8f084b.mp4?t=1694060749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Control your athlete directly with unique controls that allow unlimited expressive freedom (and hilarious fails!)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed By a Gymnast/Acrobat</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1214520/extras/2329818057f98103bc78a6e32772089c.poster.avif?t=1694060749\" width=480 height=220 ><sourc